{"title":"Career Roadmap: Mathematics & Computing → Data Scientist","role":"Data Scientist","summary":"A Data Scientist combines mathematics, statistics, programming and domain knowledge to extract insights from data and build predictive or analytical systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Mathematics & Computing"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Domain","text":"Data Science, Machine Learning, Statistics, Artificial Intelligence & Decision Analytics"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Scientist combines mathematics, statistics, programming and domain knowledge to extract insights from data and build predictive or analytical systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data collection and preparation"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Predictive modeling"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Business problem solving"},{"text":"Deployment and monitoring of models"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a Mathematics & Computing graduate, this is a particularly strong career mapping because the degree naturally develops the mathematical foundation required for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Algorithms"},{"text":"Computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The key is to complement the mathematical foundation with Python, SQL, machine learning, data engineering fundamentals and business communication."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Role Direction","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Computing/Mathematics Student"},{"text":"Programming, mathematics and statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Data Analytics Intern"},{"text":"SQL, Python, visualization and statistics"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"ML/Data Science Intern"},{"text":"Machine learning and experimentation"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Data Science Intern / Research Intern"},{"text":"Advanced ML and end-to-end projects"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Junior Data Scientist / Data Analyst / ML Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics and predictive modeling"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Data Scientist"},{"text":"End-to-end ML and business problems"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Senior Data Scientist / ML Scientist"},{"text":"Advanced modeling and technical ownership"}],[{"text":"8–12+ Years"},{"text":"Principal Data Scientist / Data Science Manager"},{"text":"Strategy, architecture and technical leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Mathematics + Programming Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a very strong mathematical and programming base."},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Discrete mathematics"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Numerical methods"},{"text":"Optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Particular emphasis should be placed on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linear Algebra"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vectors"},{"text":"Matrices"},{"text":"Matrix multiplication"},{"text":"Eigenvalues"},{"text":"Eigenvectors"},{"text":"Vector spaces"},{"text":"Matrix decomposition"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These concepts become important in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Neural networks"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Dimensionality reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Classes"},{"text":"Modules"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","NumPy","Pandas","Matplotlib","SciPy","Scikit-learn"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 — Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Become highly comfortable working with real datasets."},{"type":"h","text":"Pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DataFrames"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicate handling"},{"text":"GroupBy"},{"text":"Merge"},{"text":"Join"},{"text":"Pivot"},{"text":"Reshaping"},{"text":"Time-series operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"},{"text":"Plotly"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how to communicate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Correlations"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Patterns"}]}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL should be a core employability skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregate functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Query optimization fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Question","Identify Data","SQL Query","Data Extraction","Python Analysis","Statistical / ML Model","Business Recommendation"]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This should be one of the student's strongest areas."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Descriptive Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Distribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Probability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conditional probability"},{"text":"Bayes theorem"},{"text":"Random variables"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Expected value"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inferential Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"p-values"},{"text":"Statistical significance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"ANOVA"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Bayesian statistics fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Mathematics & Computing student should understand the mathematics behind statistical methods, rather than treating them as black-box library functions."}]},{"heading":"Year 2–3 — Machine Learning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong classical ML fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Supervised Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting"},{"text":"XGBoost/LightGBM concepts"},{"text":"Support vector machines"},{"text":"k-nearest neighbors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Unsupervised Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"K-means"},{"text":"Hierarchical clustering"},{"text":"DBSCAN"},{"text":"PCA"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]}]},{"heading":"Machine Learning Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn the complete process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Data Collection","Data Cleaning","Exploratory Data Analysis","Feature Engineering","Train / Validation / Test Split","Model Training","Evaluation","Hyperparameter Tuning","Model Interpretation","Deployment","Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is much more valuable than simply knowing individual ML algorithms."}]},{"heading":"Model Evaluation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the correct metrics for different problems."},{"type":"h","text":"Regression"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MAE"},{"text":"MSE"},{"text":"RMSE"},{"text":"R²"},{"text":"MAPE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Classification"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Recall"},{"text":"F1-score"},{"text":"ROC-AUC"},{"text":"PR-AUC"},{"text":"Confusion matrix"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clustering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Silhouette score"},{"text":"Within-cluster variation"},{"text":"Cluster interpretability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Overfitting"},{"text":"Underfitting"},{"text":"Bias-variance tradeoff"},{"text":"Cross-validation"},{"text":"Data leakage"},{"text":"Class imbalance"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Feature Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong practical skill in transforming raw data into useful model inputs."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing-value treatment"},{"text":"Encoding categorical variables"},{"text":"Scaling"},{"text":"Normalization"},{"text":"Feature selection"},{"text":"Feature extraction"},{"text":"Date/time features"},{"text":"Text features"},{"text":"Interaction features"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Data","Cleaning","Transformation","Feature Engineering","Feature Selection","ML Model","Evaluation"]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Machine Learning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"During Year 3–4, learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ensemble Methods"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Random Forest"},{"text":"Gradient Boosting"},{"text":"XGBoost"},{"text":"LightGBM"},{"text":"CatBoost concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Time-Series"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trend"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Stationarity"},{"text":"ARIMA concepts"},{"text":"Exponential smoothing"},{"text":"Forecast evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommender Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collaborative filtering"},{"text":"Content-based recommendation"},{"text":"Ranking"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3–4 — Deep Learning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals rather than trying to learn every architecture."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Neural Networks"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perceptron"},{"text":"Activation functions"},{"text":"Forward propagation"},{"text":"Backpropagation"},{"text":"Loss functions"},{"text":"Optimizers"},{"text":"Regularization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Frameworks"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary framework:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PyTorch"},{"text":"TensorFlow/Keras"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Time-series modeling"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Generative AI & LLMs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Data Scientist should understand the fundamentals of generative AI."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transformers"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"LLM fundamentals"},{"text":"Prompting"},{"text":"Vector databases"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"Fine-tuning concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents / Data","Chunking","Embeddings","Vector Database","Retriever","LLM","Generated Response","Evaluation"]},{"type":"p","text":"However, LLMs should complement—not replace—the core statistics and machine-learning foundation."}]},{"heading":"Data Engineering Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Scientist should understand how data reaches the model."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"ETL / ELT"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Batch processing"},{"text":"Basic cloud storage"},{"text":"Data quality"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Sources","ETL / ELT","Data Warehouse / Lake","Data Preparation","Data Science","ML Model","Application"]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a full-time data engineer, but you should understand the infrastructure surrounding data science."}]},{"heading":"MLOps Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how models move from notebooks to production."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Model versioning"},{"text":"Experiment tracking"},{"text":"CI/CD concepts"},{"text":"Model monitoring"},{"text":"Data drift"},{"text":"Model drift"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Notebook","Training Pipeline","Model Registry","API","Application","Monitoring","Retraining"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools to explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"MLflow"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"Cloud ML platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Cloud Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Choose one major cloud platform."},{"type":"h","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"S3"},{"text":"EC2"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"RDS"},{"text":"Lambda"},{"text":"CloudWatch"},{"text":"Basic ML/cloud services"}]},{"type":"p","text":"or equivalent services on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"},{"text":"The objective is to understand how data-science systems operate beyond a local Jupyter notebook."}]}]},{"heading":"Data Visualization & Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Scientist must translate technical analysis into decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI / Tableau"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Segments"},{"text":"Forecasts"},{"text":"Anomalies"},{"text":"Business performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Be able to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What happened?"},{"text":"Why did it happen?"},{"text":"What will happen?"},{"text":"What should the organization do?"},{"text":"This distinction separates a technically capable data scientist from someone who only builds models."}]}]},{"heading":"Final-Year Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — End-to-End Customer Churn Prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Data","SQL Extraction","Data Cleaning","EDA","Feature Engineering","ML Models","Evaluation","Explainability","API","Dashboard"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model comparison"},{"text":"Feature importance"},{"text":"Business recommendations"},{"text":"Deployment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Demand Forecasting System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a time-series forecasting system."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical sales"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Trend"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Error analysis"},{"text":"Inventory recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Recommendation System"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a recommendation engine for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Movies"},{"text":"Courses"},{"text":"Jobs"},{"text":"Compare different recommendation strategies."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Fraud Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an imbalanced classification system."},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Precision/recall"},{"text":"Class imbalance"},{"text":"Threshold tuning"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Model explainability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — GenAI + RAG Data Science Application"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a domain-specific RAG system."},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","Chunking","Embeddings","Vector Database","Retriever","LLM","Answer","Evaluation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retrieval evaluation"},{"text":"Hallucination checks"},{"text":"Source grounding"},{"text":"API deployment"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Primary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science Intern"},{"text":"Machine Learning Intern"},{"text":"Data Analytics Intern"},{"text":"AI/ML Intern"},{"text":"Quantitative Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Decision Science Intern"},{"text":"Business Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Secondary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Risk Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Operations Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Work to Prioritize"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for work involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Dashboarding"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Model deployment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An internship where the student works with real datasets and measurable business problems is preferable to one consisting primarily of tutorial-based ML projects."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"Data Scientist"},{"text":"Associate Data Scientist"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Data Analyst"},{"text":"Product Data Analyst"},{"text":"Machine Learning Analyst"},{"text":"ML Engineer Trainee"},{"text":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"text":"Decision Scientist"},{"text":"Quantitative Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Data Scientist"},{"text":"Operations Data Scientist"},{"text":"Research Data Scientist"},{"text":"AI/ML Engineer"},{"text":"Data Science Consultant"},{"text":"Forecasting Analyst"},{"text":"Applied Scientist — where employer eligibility permits"},{"text":"Research Engineer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a fresh B.Tech graduate, Data Analyst, Junior Data Scientist, ML Analyst or Data Science Intern → full-time can sometimes be a more accessible entry path than immediately targeting highly research-intensive Data Scientist roles."}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Pandas / NumPy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Feature Engineering"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Model Evaluation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI / Tableau"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Business Understanding"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For Data Science, portfolio quality and demonstrable skills generally matter more than accumulating certificates."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python for Data Science"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data Visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Time-Series"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"MLOps"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"API development"},{"text":"Experiment tracking"}]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Mathematics & Computing"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Computational Science"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M.Sc."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Applied Mathematics"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Computational Mathematics"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for later product/business roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Business Intelligence"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Technology Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technically ambitious Data Scientist, M.Tech/MS/M.Sc. in Data Science, Statistics, AI/ML or Computational Mathematics is generally more directly aligned than an MBA."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Product Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User behavior"},{"text":"Product metrics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Recommendation"},{"text":"Product experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predictive models"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Model optimization"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. NLP / Generative AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"LLMs"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Text classification"},{"text":"Information retrieval"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Object detection"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Vision-language models"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Quantitative / Risk Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Time-series"},{"text":"Risk modeling"},{"text":"The Mathematics & Computing background can be particularly useful here."}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Operations & Decision Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Simulation"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Supply-chain analytics"},{"text":"Pricing"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Data Science Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst / Junior Data Scientist","Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","Staff / Principal Data Scientist","Principal / Lead Data Scientist"]},{"type":"h","text":"ML Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["ML Analyst / ML Engineer","Machine Learning Engineer","Senior ML Engineer","ML Tech Lead","Principal ML Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Scientist","Research Scientist / Applied Scientist","Senior Research Scientist","Principal Scientist","Research / AI Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The Data Scientist role is rapidly expanding into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Foundation models"},{"text":"Multimodal AI"},{"text":"Agentic AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Synthetic data"},{"text":"Automated machine learning"},{"text":"Explainable AI"},{"text":"Federated learning"},{"text":"Graph machine learning"},{"text":"Real-time ML"},{"text":"Edge AI"},{"text":"AI agents for data analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is not simply:"},{"type":"p","text":"Python + ML."},{"type":"p","text":"It is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mathematics","Statistics","Data Engineering","ML","GenAI","Deployment","Domain Knowledge."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Probability & Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Feature Engineering"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Understanding","DATA SCIENTIST"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a Mathematics & Computing graduate, an especially strong differentiator is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mathematical Modeling"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["AI","Advanced Data Science"]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be capable of taking a real-world problem from raw data to a deployable analytical solution:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Problem Formulation","Data Collection","SQL / Data Extraction","Data Cleaning","EDA","Statistical Analysis","Feature Engineering","Machine Learning","Model Evaluation","Explainability","Deployment","Monitoring","Business Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Minimum portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"2 end-to-end Data Science projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1 strong machine-learning project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 time-series/forecasting project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 SQL project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 GenAI/RAG project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 deployed ML application/API"},{"type":"h","text":"Strong statistics portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"GitHub portfolio with clean documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"At least one relevant internship"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Mathematics & Computing graduate who knows Python and machine learning.”"},{"type":"p","text":"It should be:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Mathematically strong Data Scientist who can formulate problems statistically, work with large datasets using Python and SQL, build and evaluate machine-learning models, and deploy data-driven solutions.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Mathematics & Computing","Data/ML Internship","Data Analyst / Junior Data Scientist","Data Scientist","Senior Data Scientist","Staff/Principal Data Scientist","Data Science/AI Technical Leadership"]}]}]}